From: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: classify external LAN ports from DT

XR1710G and W1700K expose an external PHY on GDM4, but that port is a
LAN member, not a WAN uplink. The driver otherwise assumes only GDM1 is
a LAN port on EN7581 and treats external GDM ports as WAN.

Allow board DTS files to mark external LAN ports explicitly with the
hardware-specific airoha,lan-port property. Keep Linux netdev naming out
of Device Tree; board network setup maps the resulting ethX devices to
OpenWrt LAN and WAN interfaces.

Origin: other, local Airoha board adaptation
Forwarded: no
Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-5.6-sol
Signed-off-by: Yanghan Ye <yyh94306@gmail.com>
---
Index: b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
===================================================================
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -79,6 +79,14 @@
 }
 #endif
 
+static bool airoha_port_is_lan(struct device_node *np, u32 id)
+{
+	if (of_property_read_bool(np, "airoha,lan-port"))
+		return true;
+
+	return id == AIROHA_GDM1_IDX;
+}
+
 static void airoha_set_macaddr(struct airoha_gdm_port *port, const u8 *addr)
 {
 	struct airoha_eth *eth = port->qdma->eth;
@@ -3103,6 +3111,7 @@
 	spin_lock_init(&port->stats.lock);
 	port->eth = eth;
 	port->dev = dev;
+	port->lan = airoha_port_is_lan(np, id);
 	port->id = id;
 	eth->ports[p] = port;
 
Index: b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h
===================================================================
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h
@@ -537,6 +537,7 @@
 	struct airoha_eth *eth;
 	struct net_device *dev;
 	int id;
+	bool lan;
 
 #if defined(CONFIG_PCS_AIROHA)
 	struct phylink *phylink;
@@ -636,11 +637,7 @@
 
 static inline bool airoha_is_lan_gdm_port(struct airoha_gdm_port *port)
 {
-	/* GDM1 port on EN7581 SoC is connected to the lan dsa switch.
-	 * GDM{2,3,4} can be used as wan port connected to an external
-	 * phy module.
-	 */
-	return port->id == 1;
+	return port->lan;
 }
 
 static inline bool airoha_is_7581(struct airoha_eth *eth)
